mc(11,'The rate rises from ₹80/$ to ₹84/$ under a flexible system. The rupee has:',['Appreciated','Depreciated','Been revalued officially','Become a fixed currency'],1,'More rupees are needed per dollar: the rupee’s external value falls.')
